dec['b03']={'decision':'retain first','changed':'no','evidence':'The single detached upper stroke above I occupies its top-serif position; there is no additional bar above a complete capital I. Retain I. In (3), the extra loop beside old X_k is continuous with the hatching and does not establish another readable sign. The full underbrace and annotation are retained. In the sloping marginal chain, the dot/short return before the long j supports compressed ij, not j alone; tel ends in its tall l without a separate s return. The underline covers k and less-than only. The cancelled trial below (3) retains its recoverable parenthesis, union-like bowl, k<j and doubtful tel q. In (4), the old j has a clear long descending hook beneath the cancellation; the live i remains separate.'}
dec['b04']={'decision':'correct first from ink','changed':'yes','evidence':'The whole proof and the existing cancelled-detail crop were inspected. Its old X_k cap X_i and final looped ell< i remain visible under the wavy strike; the proposed et stays doubtful. All seven live looped ell forms and the literal unsubscripted dotted X agree. After the live X_ell proper-subset X_i at the end of the implique line, the paper is blank before the next-line d-où: remove the supplied comma. Other visible commas and the final dash remain.'}
t=t.replace(r'\inserted{R_{i,j}^{\deleted{\unsure{*}}}}',r'\inserted{\unsure{R|a}_{i,j}^{\deleted{\unsure{*}}}}').replace(r'implique $X_\ell\subsetneq X_i$,',r'implique $X_\ell\subsetneq X_i$')
